<%# The Parent field on the loader name synonym and misapplied edit forms:
    on stimulus-autocomplete, instead of the typeahead.js widget set up by
    setUpLoaderNameParentTypeahead (now gone).

    Suggestions are the accepted and excluded loader names in this record's
    batch, labelled "<simple name> (<id>) ". Loader::Names::ParentTypeahead
    resolves the text on save, since the library empties the hidden
    parent_id whenever the text is edited.

    Locals: f, loader_name, title. %>
<%= render "shared/autocomplete_field",
           f: f,
           id_attribute: :parent_id,
           input_id: "loader-name-parent-typeahead",
           input_name: "loader_name[parent_typeahead]",
           input_value: loader_name.parent&.simple_name,
           label: "Parent",
           title: title,
           url: loader_names_parent_suggestions_path(format: :html),
           extra_params: { loader_batch_id: loader_name.loader_batch_id,
                           avoid_id: loader_name.id } %>
<p>If you change the parent, please also consider changing the seq field.</p>
